{"3078120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reality Drift", "steam_appid": 3078120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/c27a6fcc599a7ef907d0e0f575e01e43.avif?t=1786057581\" width=780 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a series of strange worlds, racing to be the first to deliver packages to obnoxious godlike creatures who have nothing but disdain for you. At the end of each track, choose between three options for a new track - you'll decide based on your stats and the linked upgrades being offered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/0f34bf364befd4cf8216684f7f5a91c9.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/0f34bf364befd4cf8216684f7f5a91c9.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/0f34bf364befd4cf8216684f7f5a91c9.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/f44e16c3c72c597ae50809553203ed9c.avif?t=1786057581\" width=780 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions include roguelike deckbuilding, where you have a deck of cards which have effects while drawn. In addition to upgrading your car using the core stats, you'll choose new cards to add to your deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/a4a6199a3e228b112b700a77c78aef5b.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/a4a6199a3e228b112b700a77c78aef5b.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/a4a6199a3e228b112b700a77c78aef5b.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/32dd9dac998f3d2ba4d4ff4781e46ff5.avif?t=1786057581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras_big/32dd9dac998f3d2ba4d4ff4781e46ff5.avif?t=1786057581 width=1560 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning in Reality Drift is as much about making the right choices as how well you drive. Will you lean into ACCEL and MAX SPEED, or will you try to go for a GRIP build where you never have to slow down? Choices are made in real-time so you only have a few seconds to decide! In addition to the core stats, extra powerups are often available including REGEN BRAKING, BOOST, SHIELD, ANTIGRAV and NAVIGATOR. The computer-controlled cars follow the same rules as you and choose which upgrades to obtain, but only you can choose what the next track will be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/754ec9c461a7b07a10d742c5de1ea313.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/754ec9c461a7b07a10d742c5de1ea313.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/754ec9c461a7b07a10d742c5de1ea313.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you win races you'll unlock a total of 26 missions, each with its own twist on the formula. Winning all races will unlock New Game+ where the difficulty will be raised and your mastery of the game will truly be tested! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/b9c7ca5c279d0e6f5d23595d1c1b5c79.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/b9c7ca5c279d0e6f5d23595d1c1b5c79.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/b9c7ca5c279d0e6f5d23595d1c1b5c79.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/c27a6fcc599a7ef907d0e0f575e01e43.avif?t=1786057581\" width=780 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a series of strange worlds, racing to be the first to deliver packages to obnoxious godlike creatures who have nothing but disdain for you. At the end of each track, choose between three options for a new track - you'll decide based on your stats and the linked upgrades being offered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/0f34bf364befd4cf8216684f7f5a91c9.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/0f34bf364befd4cf8216684f7f5a91c9.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/0f34bf364befd4cf8216684f7f5a91c9.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/f44e16c3c72c597ae50809553203ed9c.avif?t=1786057581\" width=780 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions include roguelike deckbuilding, where you have a deck of cards which have effects while drawn. In addition to upgrading your car using the core stats, you'll choose new cards to add to your deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/a4a6199a3e228b112b700a77c78aef5b.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/a4a6199a3e228b112b700a77c78aef5b.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/a4a6199a3e228b112b700a77c78aef5b.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/32dd9dac998f3d2ba4d4ff4781e46ff5.avif?t=1786057581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras_big/32dd9dac998f3d2ba4d4ff4781e46ff5.avif?t=1786057581 width=1560 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning in Reality Drift is as much about making the right choices as how well you drive. Will you lean into ACCEL and MAX SPEED, or will you try to go for a GRIP build where you never have to slow down? Choices are made in real-time so you only have a few seconds to decide! In addition to the core stats, extra powerups are often available including REGEN BRAKING, BOOST, SHIELD, ANTIGRAV and NAVIGATOR. The computer-controlled cars follow the same rules as you and choose which upgrades to obtain, but only you can choose what the next track will be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/754ec9c461a7b07a10d742c5de1ea313.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/754ec9c461a7b07a10d742c5de1ea313.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/754ec9c461a7b07a10d742c5de1ea313.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you win races you'll unlock a total of 26 missions, each with its own twist on the formula. Winning all races will unlock New Game+ where the difficulty will be raised and your mastery of the game will truly be tested! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/b9c7ca5c279d0e6f5d23595d1c1b5c79.poster.avif?t=1786057581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/b9c7ca5c279d0e6f5d23595d1c1b5c79.webm?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/extras/b9c7ca5c279d0e6f5d23595d1c1b5c79.mp4?t=1786057581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Reality Drift is a strategic roguelike racing game. Race through a series of strange worlds, choose upgrades, cards and relics, and decide which track will be next - your decisions are just as important as how you drive!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Ukrainian, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/9d93921288cadddc13ad29cd3e777552d234ebc7/header.jpg?t=1786057581", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/70e5532539131b3f8aa0f75e3aff2e3b100b1b16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786057581", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078120/70e5532539131b3f8aa0f75e3aff2e3b100b1b16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786057581", "website": "https://industries.arganoid.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 3rd generation or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 6th generation or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requi